  "title": "macOS: Update our .dmg compression algorithms",
  "description": "Switch our app .dmg compression to ULFO. It produces smaller files than\nUDZO and is the format that diskutil uses by default. Switch our dsym\n.dmg compression to ULMO. It produces the smallest files and if no one\ncomplains we can use it for our app .dmgs in the future.\n\nChange some \"hdiutil\" references to \"diskutil\" since the former has been\ndeprecated in favor of the latter.",
